["<div class=\"page\"></div>", "<article></article>", "<div>/  /</div>", "<a>hjr265.me</a>", "<a>blog</a>", "<header class=\"-leaf\"></header>", "<h1>Links for Social Network Share Dialogs</h1>", "<div class=\"flair\"></div>", "<span class=\"flair__item muted\">January 7, 2023</span>", "<span class=\"flair__item\"></span>", "<a class=\"muted\">#100DaysToOffload</a>", "<a class=\"muted\">#Debloat</a>", "<a class=\"muted\">#Web</a>", "<div class=\"wide\"></div>", "<div class=\"main\"></div>", "<article></article>", "<p>You have a few options to add social network sharing buttons to your website or web app.</p>", "<p>One, you can embed their JavaScript  SDKs. If your site needs 21st-century Internet bloat, this is w</p>", "<del>operating systems</del>", "<p>Two, you can use third-party share button JavaScript libraries. There are way too many of these out </p>", "<p>But if you know me, I prefer lean solutions. And nothing beats using simple anchor elements with lin</p>", "<a>Toph</a>", "<p>In this post, I am sharing a list of links to share dialogs for various social network websites:</p>", "<ul></ul>", "<li>:</li>", "<strong>Facebook</strong>", "<code>https://facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u={url}</code>", "<li>:</li>", "<strong>Twitter</strong>", "<code>https://twitter.com/intent/tweet/?text={text}&url={url}</code>", "<li>:</li>", "<strong>LinkedIn</strong>", "<code>https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url={url}&title={text}</code>", "<li>:</li>", "<strong>Telegram</strong>", "<code>https://telegram.me/share/url?text={text}&url={url}</code>", "<p>Example:</p>", "<div></div>", "<p></p>", "<a></a>", "<img src=\"facebook.png\" style=\"border-radius:.25rem;width:2rem\"></img>", "<a></a>", "<img src=\"twitter.png\" style=\"border-radius:.25rem;width:2rem\"></img>", "<a></a>", "<img src=\"linkedin.png\" style=\"border-radius:.25rem;width:2rem\"></img>", "<a></a>", "<img src=\"telegram.png\" style=\"border-radius:.25rem;width:2rem\"></img>", "<p>Got links for more social network share dialogs? Please leave them in the comments below.</p>", "<p></p>", "<em>This post is 10th of my  challenge. Want to get involved? Find out more at .</em>", "<a>#100DaysToOffload</a>", "<a>100daystooffload.com</a>", "<hr></hr>", "<a class=\"dsq-brlink\">comments powered by</a>", "<span class=\"logo-disqus\">Disqus</span>", "<div></div>", "<div class=\"box\"></div>", "<div class=\"box__body\"></div>", "<div style=\"font-weight:700\">Similar Blog Posts</div>", "<div></div>", "<div></div>", "<a>Embedding a JavaScript Library (KaTeX) in Go</a>", "<div class=\"flair\"></div>", "<span class=\"flair__item muted\">December 24, 2022</span>", "<span class=\"flair__item\"></span>", "<a class=\"muted\">#100DaysToOffload</a>", "<a class=\"muted\">#Go</a>", "<a class=\"muted\">#JavaScript</a>", "<span class=\"flair__more muted\" style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted #000;cursor:help\">+1</span>", "<div></div>", "<div></div>", "<a>Block All But One Website With Windows Defender Firewall</a>", "<div class=\"flair\"></div>", "<span class=\"flair__item muted\">December 11, 2022</span>", "<span class=\"flair__item\"></span>", "<a class=\"muted\">#100DaysToOffload</a>", "<a class=\"muted\">#Network</a>", "<a class=\"muted\">#Windows</a>", "<span class=\"flair__more muted\" style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted #000;cursor:help\">+2</span>"]